The MIT licence above covers the analysis code in this repository.

It does NOT cover the third-party atlases, surfaces and reference maps vendored
under `templates/`, which are redistributed under their own terms:

  - HCP-MMP parcellation and associated fsLR surfaces (Glasser et al.) —
    HCP Open Access Data Use Terms
  - Yeo 7/17-network parcellation (Yeo et al.)
  - Gordon 17-network parcellation, via cbig_network_correspondence
  - fsLR medial-wall masks, from the neuromaps data distribution
  - Multi-task dimensionality map (Ito & Murray)

See `templates/MANIFEST.md` for provenance. Confirm each upstream licence
before redistributing them further.

Derived data associated with this repository is deposited separately and is
subject to the Healthy Brain Network and Child Mind Institute Biobank data
access terms, not to this licence.
